#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0241 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "TRTAG1N, the operator's TARGET and the rule's single Requirements.Variables.All entry, is absent. The expansion still happens -- TRTAGy matches TRTAG1, tuple y=1, and TRTAGyN is synthesised as the absent TRTAG1N -- and Requirements.Variables.All rewrites to ['TRTAG1N'], which is absent, so the rule is reported not executed with the Requirements.Variables reason. NOT a wildcard NoMatch: one column did match."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col TRTAG1  type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | GLUC | POOLA
S1 | 002 | GLUC | POOLB
